<title>JAPAN: JR East says to issue 130 bln yen bonds in '97/98.</title>
<headline>JR East says to issue 130 bln yen bonds in '97/98.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>East Japan Railway Co (JR East) said on Friday that it would issue 130 billion yen worth of corporate bonds in the year to March 31, 1998.</p>
<p>It unveiled the plan in its overall business plan for fiscal 1997/98 which was issued on Friday.</p>
</text>
